g.
Notice. All notices arising out ofor from the provisions of this Agreement shall be
in writing and given to the Parties either by regular mail or delivery in person.
h.
Nondiscrimination. The Contractor shall comply with the Civil Rights Act of 1964,
the Wyoming Fair Employment Practices Act, Wyo. Stat. § 27-9-105, et seq., and the Americans
with Disabilities Act (ADA), as amended, 42 U.S.C. § 12101, et seq. The Contractor shall assure
that no person is subjected to discrimination because of age, sex, race, religion, national origin or
disability in connection with the performance of this Agreement.
